The trip with the metro is over.
Now I am going up to the street.
I take the escalator.
The sun is shining up on the street.
Now I am going to the water.
I am going by the harbour bus.
I walk down a wide street.
Then I see the canal.
The water is very blue.
I look for my stop.
Where does the boat stop?
I walk closer to the edge.
Then I see a small wooden pier.
It is located right down by the water.
There is a yellow sign by the pier.
It says "Harbour bus" on the sign.
This is the right place.
I walk out onto the pier.
Now I am just waiting for the boat.
